  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ca81259519cadfb2d5350673c220e419e60378e9770ad26512fc8e826a8d93f1.png] __Shortcut Trick__\n\nApply the BODMAS rule and use fraction equivalents for faster decimal multiplication.\n\n⇒ (2.4 + 3.125) × 0.25 − (0.75 ÷ 0.3)\n\n⇒ 5.525 × (1/4) − 2.5\n\n⇒ 1.38125 − 2.5 = −1.11875\n\n**∴ The correct answer is -1.11875.**\n\n<img height=\"26px\" src=\"https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/c76c13ba2d2ab46b47f8a9",
